  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Let \\(F\\) be the number of chimichangas made on Friday. The Tuesday production is \\(130\\), so the Friday-to-Tuesday ratio is\n\n\\[\nF:130.\n\\]\n\nSince the Friday production amount is not provided, the ratio cannot be determined. The information about Carla’s Taco Stand is irrelevant.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined from the given information}}\n\\]",
